    "first_attempt_detail": "Per-job 10 seconds starts on the first request call, including request returning token 0. The 1-second transport retry preserves that start. Queue waiting before the first request is limited by the generation resource deadline. A later optional-to-required promotion can create one fresh required job, still under the original generation 60-second resource deadline.",
